            "chunk_type": "insider_holding",
            "content": "Michael K. Wirth, Chairman of the Board, entered into a pre-arranged stock trading plan in November 2021. Mr. Wirth's plan provides for the potential exercise of vested stock options and the associated sale of up to 93,000 shares of Chevron common stock between February 2022 and March 2023.",
            "entity_name": "Michael K. Wirth",
            "entity_type_entity": "Person",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_9B"
            },
            "chunk_type": "insider_holding",
            "content": "Pierre R. Breber, Vice President and Chief Financial Officer, entered into a pre-arranged stock trading plan in November 2021. Mr. Breber's plan provides for the potential exercise of vested stock options and the associated sale of up to 18,500 shares of Chevron common stock between February 2022 and January 2023.",
            "entity_name": "Pierre R. Breber",
            "entity_type_entity": "Person",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_9B"
            },
            "chunk_type": "insider_holding",
            "content": "Rhonda J. Morris, Vice President and Chief Human Resources Officer, and her spouse each entered into pre-arranged stock trading plans in November 2021. The plans for Ms. Morris and her spouse provide for the potential exercise of vested stock options and the associated sale of up to 17,300 and 11,300 shares of Chevron common stock, respectively, between February 2022 and January 2023.",
            "entity_name": "Rhonda J. Morris",
            "entity_type_entity": "Person",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_9B"
            },
            "chunk_type": "insider_holding",
            "content": "Colin E. Parfitt, Vice President, Midstream, entered into a pre-arranged stock trading plan in November 2021. Mr. Parfitt's plan provides for the potential exercise of vested stock options and the associated sale of up to 55,500 shares of Chevron common stock between February 2022 and January 2023.",
            "entity_name": "Colin E. Parfitt",
            "entity_type_entity": "Person",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
